OL,3,GNEWSABridge closure impact
OL,4,A'unmanageable', says business
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses have said they have had
OL,7,Ffewer customers and reduced earnings
OL,8,Fafter one of a town's main bridges was
OL,9,Fclosed for repairs.
OL,11,FNether Bridge in Kendal, Cumbria, has
OL,12,Fbeen closed to vehicles since Monday to
OL,13,Fallow for heritage stonework to be
OL,14,Frestored after part of the structure
OL,15,Fwas knocked into the river in June.
OL,17,FDirector of Blue Star Taxis Usman
OL,18,FSaleem described the situation as
OL,19,F"unmanageable", saying his drivers
OL,20,Fearned at least 25% less each day,
OL,21,Fwhile shop Pete Bland Sports on
OL,22,FKirkland has reported falling footfall.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
