OL,3,GNEWSABridge closure impact
OL,4,A'unmanageable', says business
OL,5,
OL,6,FWestmorland and Furness Council said
OL,7,Fthe closure allowed for repairs using
OL,8,Ftraditional lime mortar which would
OL,9,Fpreserve the bridge's character.
